      *
      * FTOTP - WCMC Outcome/Savings Table File
      *******************************************************************
      *
      *   Used to define codes that may be utilized in
      *   'Work with Outocomes/Savings' option off of Pre-Cert or
      *   Case Service.
      *
      *******************************************************************
      *
      *
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R POT01                     TEXT('Outcome/Savings Table File')
     A            OTCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A                                      COLHDG('CO#')
     A            OTCODE    R               REFFLD(KEY)
     A                                      COLHDG('Outcome/Savings code')
     A            OTDESC    R               REFFLD(DS70)
     A                                      COLHDG('Description')
     A            OTRTVL    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Savings rate value')
      *                  valid values: FTGTP via 'RTVL'
      *
     A            OTSVRT    R               REFFLD(A92)
     A                                      COLHDG('Savings rate')
     A            OTPERC    R               REFFLD(PC52)
     A                                      COLHDG('Less Percentage')
      *
      *
     A            OTSTAT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('RCD' 'STATUS')
     A            OTUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'USER')
     A            OTPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'PGM')
     A            OTTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'TIME')
     A            OTDT      R               REFFLD(DT7)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'DATE')
      *
     A            OTIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'USER')
     A            OTIPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'PGM')
     A            OTITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'TIME')
     A            OTIDT     R               REFFLD(DT7)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'DATE')
      *
